<p>Raise your Dark Whispers in radius 10 to a deafening crescendo for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns, applying another stack and drowning out all thought. </p><p>Targets afflicted by Dark Whispers will have 20% higher chance to spawn hallucinations, and each time they take damage from your Dark Whispers or Sanity Warp they will take an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">89%, 120%, 144%, 165%, 183%</acronym> damage as temporal damage.</p><p>The damage will improve with your Spellpower.</p>